olor:#121212;">
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Anthropic=E2=80=99s plan to float on the s=
tock market has provided a sobering insight into the risks that AI poses, e=
ven as it attempts to pull off a massive share sale to the public.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Reuters has taken a look at Anthropic=E2=
=80=99s IPO prospectus =E2=80=93 the legal document that outlines a company=
=E2=80=99s financial details before it floats on the stock market =E2=80=93=
 and found that it includes a warning that advanced AI could be a =E2=80=9C=
catastrophic or existential risks to humanity.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The filing explains: =E2=80=9COur developm=
ent of highly advanced models, platforms, and applications and expansion of=
 use cases could further increase the risk that our models cause harm.=E2=
=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">And after a flurry of stories about AI mod=
els going rogue, Anthropic flags that its models could conceal information =
and exhibit behaviour resembling blackmail, and resist efforts to shut them=
 down.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">It cautions: =E2=80=9CPotential model awar=
eness of our evaluation efforts creates a significant limitation on our abi=
lity to assess model safety.=E2=80=9D</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Such warnings appear across 80 pages devot=
ed to risk factors in the prospectus, almost a third of the document.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Despite these warnings, Anthropic is aimin=
g for one of the largest stock market flotations ever, which could value it=
 at more than $2tn.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The IPO prospectus shows that Anthropic=E2=
=80=99s revenue grew 12-fold in 2025 to nearly $4.6bn =E2=80=93 with nearly=
 a quarter coming from just two customers.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">But its operating loss swelled to over $8b=
n last year, from nearly $3bn in 2024.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The IPO is expected to take place after th=
e US midterm elections in November, and will be a serious test of investor =
interest, and concern, around AI.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Yesterday, a group of senior AI executives=
 =E2=80=93 and two of the =E2=80=9Cgodfathers=E2=80=9D of the technology =
=E2=80=93 <a href=3D"https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_=
JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMgszcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFeIS8Jgzm9OhrPvl=
QEkS24HPL6oEigEFMUw4v4FQCZLbl0R2T58oUTA0f5Yx2wgdcDXNtwQgO2fcCbvEh0FUI8ivU83=
